[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（英音）]
[ti:Please Send Me a Card]
[00:14.00]How many cards did the writer send?
[00:20.10]Postcards always spoil my holidays.
[00:24.41]Last summer, I went to Italy.
[00:27.57]I visited museums and sat in public gardens.
[00:32.45]A friendly waiter taught me a few words of Italian.
[00:36.47]Then he lent me a book.
[00:39.66]I read a few lines,
[00:42.03]but I did not understand a word.
[00:45.23]Everyday I thought about postcards.
[00:48.93]My holidays passed quickly,
[00:51.50]but I did not send cards to my friends.
[00:55.63]On the last day I made a big decision.
[00:59.92]I got up early and bought thirty-seven cards.
[01:06.66]I spent the whole day in my room,
[01:10.35]but I did not write a single card!
